 "annotations": [
  "agent summary: The gas meter reads high from about day 10. Before that, measured gas was about 0.84 of the model's value (calls 4 and 17); afterwards it was about 1.30 (bias_z 13.2, step at day 10 with step_z 6.4, call 5). Measured methane COD plus effluent COD exceeds the declared COD input (closure mean -0.163, call 3), yet independent digestate COD and TAN assays on day 105 agree with the default model (disagreement_z -0.61 and 1.29, calls 19 and 20), and no kinetic parameter moves gas by more than about 80 m3/d (Morris, call 13). So the cause is a metering error, not the influent or the kinetics. gas_flow is flagged and the prediction stays at the default parameters. Fitted values are declined because the refit (call 22) pushed Y_ac to 0.675, which compensates for background misfit, and left k_hyd_li",
  "duration guard: 13.83 s per evaluation (measured; 70 evaluations measured so far)"
 ],
